+// The host:: services the shared GX decoder and the OpenGL renderer call, on Switch 2.
+// Adapted from port/linux/gx_host_compat.cpp: guest memory is the NRO's own (mu_mem1 and the game
+// image), scene and retrace come from the Switch host.
+// SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-or-later
